": "Good.", "start": 125.632, "end": 125.933}, {"i": 297, "text": "Take", "start": 126.814, "end": 126.994}, {"i": 298, "text": "care,", "start": 127.034, "end": 127.295}, {"i": 299, "text": "Karen.", "start": 127.355, "end": 127.716}, {"i": 300, "text": "Thank", "start": 128.316, "end": 128.517}, {"i": 301, "text": "you,", "start": 128.537, "end": 128.657}, {"i": 302, "text": "Dr.", "start": 128.677, "end": 128.958}, {"i": 303, "text": "Reese.", "start": 128.998, "end": 129.278}, {"i": 304, "text": "Goodbye.", "start": 129.919, "end": 130.32}], "segments": [{"start": 0.098, "end": 0.798, "text": "Hello, Karen."}, {"start": 1.298, "end": 2.199, "text": "Good to see you again."}, {"start": 2.779, "end": 3.859, "text": "Come in and sit down."}, {"start": 4.779, "end": 5.68, "text": "Thank you, Dr. Reese."}, {"start": 6.6, "end": 10.981, "text": "Before we start, are the birds still coming to the garden feeder you mentioned last time?"}, {"start": 11.681, "end": 12.882, "text": "They are, I think."}, {"start": 13.522, "end": 14.402, "text": "Mostly in the morning."}, {"start": 15.163, "end": 16.063, "text": "That sounds nice."}, {"start": 17.303, "end": 18.724, "text": "Right, on to today."}, {"start": 19.544, "end": 23.465, "text": "You are here for your yearly influenza vaccination, is that correct?"}, {"start": 24.225, "end": 25.586, "text": "Yes, the annual one."}, {"start": 26.386, "end": 26.646, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 27.422, "end": 30.705, "text": "That is the seasonal flu vaccine that we offer once a year."}, {"start": 31.525, "end": 33.147, "text": "Does that match what you were expecting?"}, {"start": 34.027, "end": 35.048, "text": "I think so, yes."}, {"start": 36.249, "end": 38.151, "text": "Let me tell you how I will structure this."}, {"start": 39.072, "end": 45.557, "text": "First, the vaccination itself, then we sit for a moment, and then we talk about what happens afterwards."}, {"start": 46.458, "end": 46.858, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 47.819, "end": 49.16, "text": "I will give the injection now."}, {"start": 49.941, "end": 51.682, "text": "Say if anything feels uncomfortable."}, {"start": 52.483, "end": 52.803, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 53.844, "end": 54.144, "text": "There."}, {"start": 54.945, "end": 56.406, "text": "That is the vaccination given."}, {"start": 56.934, "end": 58.695, "text": "Exactly as planned for this season."}, {"start": 59.676, "end": 60.316, "text": "That was quick."}, {"start": 61.117, "end": 61.938, "text": "It usually is."}, {"start": 63.018, "end": 64.88, "text": "Now I would like to sit with you a moment."}, {"start": 65.82, "end": 67.341, "text": "Are you noticing anything at all?"}, {"start": 68.282, "end": 68.542, "text": "No."}, {"start": 69.062, "end": 70.023, "text": "Nothing, I think."}, {"start": 70.964, "end": 72.365, "text": "Nothing at the injection site?"}, {"start": 73.105, "end": 74.686, "text": "Nothing else you have noticed since?"}, {"start": 75.807, "end": 76.027, "text": "No."}, {"start": 76.768, "end": 78.849, "text": "I am not sure I feel anything at all, really."}, {"start": 79.89, "end": 80.19, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 80.891, "end": 83.452, "text": "Then I can say that there were no side effects today."}, {"start": 84.773, "end": 85.574, "text": "That is a relief."}, {"start": 86.466, "end": 91.567, "text": "When I say side effects, I mean any unwanted reaction to the vaccine itself."}, {"start": 92.368, "end": 93.048, "text": "There were none."}, {"start": 94.148, "end": 95.328, "text": "Right, I understand."}, {"start": 96.229, "end": 99.87, "text": "Is that clear so far, or would you like me to go over any of it again?"}, {"start": 100.99, "end": 102.35, "text": "No, I think it is clear."}, {"start": 103.31, "end": 104.431, "text": "Then let me summarize."}, {"start": 105.431, "end": 108.152, "text": "You came for your annual influenza vaccination."}, {"start": 108.792, "end": 111.913, "text": "It was given as planned, and there were no side effects."}, {"start": 112.813, "end": 113.113, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 113.233, "end": 116.234, "text": "As for what comes next, nothing further is needed."}, {"start": 117.018, "end": 118.941, "text": "No extra measures from my side."}, {"start": 119.602, "end": 120.824, "text": "So I just go home?"}, {"start": 121.626, "end": 122.106, "text": "Exactly."}, {"start": 122.768, "end": 124.731, "text": "Nothing more follows from today's visit."}, {"start": 125.632, "end": 125.933, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 126.814, "end": 127.716, "text": "Take care, Karen."}, {"start": 128.316, "end": 129.278, "text": "Thank you, Dr. Reese."}, {"start": 129.919, "end": 130.32, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.277}}